      "content": "I'm sorry to hear that. First, give yourself some time to stand still and rest in a calm, quiet space. Hold your head gently and take slow, deep breaths to help with the dizziness. Consider dimming the light on your phone to a comfortable level, or remove the screen if possible. If the dizziness persists or worsens, it's best to ask if you can call a work colleague or rest in a seated position until you can recover and complete your shift safely. Keep hydrated and don't rush – your health is more important.",
